    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Words with «máy» (machine)",
     "texto": [
      "Many modern things are formed with **máy** (machine) + another word:",
      "**máy lạnh** = air conditioning (machine + cold) · **máy bay** = plane (machine + fly) · **xe máy** = motorbike (vehicle + machine) · **máy chụp hình** = camera.",
      "At home you will also hear **tắm hoa sen** = shower (lit. «bathing with a lotus flower», because of the shape of the tap) and **bồn tắm** = bathtub."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
